The '''Hub Well''' is a structure found n the {{Zone|Village}} between spawn and the {{Zone|Museum}}. During zodiac events, it is replaced with a different structure themed around that event, including the {{Item|Year of the Pig}}, {{Item|Year of the Seal}}, and {{Item|Year of the Witch}}.

